<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES NEARLY UNCHANGHED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES NEARLY UNCHANGHED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were nearly</p>
<p>unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday. The</p>
<p>shortest maturity fell one basis point to 3.04 percent.</p>
<p>					  Dec 31 fix	  Dec 30 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			 3.04 pct	    3.05 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			 3.05 pct	    3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			 3.09 pct	    3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			 3.19 pct	    3.19 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			 3.29 pct	    3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			3.37 pct	    3.37 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
